Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: Add the Apple S5L8960X touchscreen
 reference clock

On the A7, channel 2 of the PWM0 block generates the 32768 Hz reference
clock of the touchscreen controller. Its count and control layout
differs from the later FPWM block, and nothing else uses the channel,
so describe it as a clock provider.

[Orchard: from thisiscamk/ipad-air-j72-linux 2a257d6,
 code/current/kernel/0001-j72-installed-kernel-snapshot.patch
 (Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,s5l8960x-touch-clock.yaml);
 maintainer set to the author instead of the Asahi list.]
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: thisiscamk <100883750+thisiscamk@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../clock/apple,s5l8960x-touch-clock.yaml     | 56 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 56 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,s5l8960x-touch-clock.yaml

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,s5l8960x-touch-clock.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,s5l8960x-touch-clock.yaml
